## What

New `pkix-aia-http` workspace crate. std-only. Mirrors `pkix-revocation-http` shape: sync HTTP fetcher implementing `pkix_aia::AiaFetcher`.

## Structure

```
pkix-aia-http/
├── Cargo.toml
├── src/
│   └── lib.rs
└── README.md
```

`Cargo.toml`:
- `pkix-aia` (path dep, workspace member)
- one of: `ureq` (sync, minimal deps, no async runtime) or `reqwest = { features = ["blocking"] }` (more featureful, larger compile)
- Recommendation: `ureq` for minimal footprint matching pkix-revocation-http precedent (verify what pkix-revocation-http uses; match if possible).

