## Acceptance

- [ ] `pkix-aia-http` crate added to workspace `Cargo.toml`
- [ ] `HttpFetcher` implements `AiaFetcher`
- [ ] Default config: 10s timeout, 1 MiB max response, "pkix-aia-http/<version>" user agent
- [ ] http:// and https:// URIs handled; ldap:// returns `AiaError::UriUnsupported`
- [ ] Test against localhost mock HTTP server returning a known intermediate cert; assert returned bytes match the served cert
- [ ] Test timeout enforcement (mock server delays response > timeout)
- [ ] Test max_response_size enforcement (mock server returns oversized body)
- [ ] Test status mapping: 404 → `AiaError::HttpStatus(404)`
- [ ] CHANGELOG entry

## Out of scope

- Async variant (file as PKIX-zkjb.5.1 if/when there's demand)
- Connection pooling tuning
- Retry policy (caller wraps with retry layer if needed)
- TLS pinning for AIA endpoints (caller responsibility)

